<% provide(:title, 'Rhombus - faqs') %>

<%= content_for :head do %>
  <%#= stylesheet_link_tag "style_home.css", "data-turbolinks-track" => true %>
  <%#= stylesheet_link_tag "responsive_home.css", "data-turbolinks-track" => true %>
  <%#= stylesheet_link_tag "custom_home.css", "data-turbolinks-track" => true %>
  <%= stylesheet_link_tag "mainly_static_pages" %>
<% end %>

<body>

	<div class="main-wrapper">
	<%= render 'shared/full_messages' %>
		<%= render 'shared/header' %>
		

<div class="section white ha-waypoint">
		<div class="container">
		<div class="p-t-60">
		<div class="row">
		<div class="col-md-12 feature-list ">
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">HOW DO I SEND A PAYMENT WITH RHOMBUS?</h4>
			<p>
			To send a payment to a merchant, local business, or non-profit, simply text the amount and description to their Rhombus number in this format: “$XX.XX, Description”. For example; “$20, 2 Burritos and a soda” or “$50, Feed the Children outreach”
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">HOW DO I KNOW MY PAYMENT WAS SENT?</h4>
			<p>
		You will receive a payment confirmation by text immediately after. You will also receive an electronic receipt by email for every payment you make.
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">IS THERE A LIMIT TO HOW MANY CHARACTERS I CAN SEND?</h4>
			<p>
Yes. There is a 160 character limit for each individual payment you send using Rhombus.
			</p>
			</div><div class="clearfix"></div>
		</div>

			<div class="col-md-12 feature-list ">
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">IS THERE A MINIMUM OR MAXIMUM AMOUNT i CAN SEND THROUGH RHOMBUS?</h4>
			<p>
			Yes. You can send a minimum payment of $1 and a maximum payment of $15,000 using Rhombus.
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">ARE THERE FEES?</h4>
			<p>
Sending a payment with Rhombus is completely free as long as you use a bank account, a supported debit card or credit card to fund your payments. To receive payments with Rhombus, we only charge 2% per transaction + card processing fees (2.9% + $0.30) to receive payments or donations. Please contact us for volume pricing.
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">WHAT BANKS DO YOUR WORK WITH?</h4>
			<p>
Your Rhombus account works with all the major banks in the United States.
			</p>
			</div><div class="clearfix"></div>
		</div>


			<div class="col-md-12 feature-list ">
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">WHEN ARE FUNDS DEPOSITED INTO MY ACCOUNT?</h4>
			<p>
		Rhombus will deposit the funds you receive during normal business hours (before 3pm PST) to your bank account the next business day. Payments processed after 3pm PT will be deposited into your bank account by the second business day.
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">WHAT COUNTRIES CAN I USE RHOMBUS IN?</h4>
			<p>
Rhombus is currently only available in the U.S. We are adding support for other countries soon.
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">WHAT PHONES DOES RHOMBUS WORK ON?</h4>
			<p>
Rhombus works on any phone with text messaging capability.
			</p>
			</div><div class="clearfix"></div>
		</div>

					<div class="col-md-12 feature-list ">
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">
WHAT IF MY PHONE IS LOST OR STOLEN</h4>
			<p>
In the event that your phone is stolen or misplaced, simply log into your Rhombus account and deactivate your payment card or account.
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="clearfix"></div>
		</div>

		</div>
		<br>
		</div>
	  </div>
	</div>




<div class="section grey">
	<div class="container">
	  <div class="p-t-40 p-b-50 ">

		<div class="row feature-list value_prop">	
 	     	<div>
		Rhombus takes the hassle out of collecting payments or donations from your customers, members or group of friends on any mobile device, using the most ubiquitous messaging system – SMS. The friction-free process lets users make a purchase or donation instantly by texting an amount and description to your Rhombus number!
			</div>

		</div>
	</div>
</div>	

<div class="section table-layout">	
			<div id="working-section" class="table-cell v-middle">	
				<div >
				<h3 class="text-white text-center custom-font no-margin">JOIN A GROWING LIST OF PEOPLE, BUSINESSES & ORGANIZATIONS USING RHOMBUS</h3>
				</div>
			</div>
</div>

<div class="section grey">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="p-t-60 p-b-60">
				<div class="row">
					<div class="col-md-8 col-md-offset-2">
						<h2 class="text-center m-b-30">We'd love to hear from you<a class="btn btn-primary btn-cons call_to_action_btn" href="/contactus">Contact Us</a></h2>				
					</div>					
				</div>
				
			</div>
		</div>
</div>

<%= render "shared/footer" %>


</body>